<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">[-]&nbsp;OK,&nbsp;now&nbsp;give&nbsp;me&nbsp;back&nbsp;my&nbsp;crit</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>While I like the core idea of a sentient fountain that produces hydrophia, I have a few concerns regarding it. The first one, and the most important, is about the way you're going to portray the fountain's consciousness. How are you going to do it? How does it communicate? Does it have a personality? Why did it decide to induce hydrophobia to the whole town?</p>
<p>My second concern is about the way you're going to structure the article. Are you going to do interviews, reports, journals, some kind of radio transmissions&#8230;? Are you planning to show the affected people's point of view?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>This draft is about 2-3 years old.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>While I think that the site's expectations have evolved, I've seen articles that old being still good ones, so I'm unsure whether this will affect the result or not.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Overall, and with the awareness that 'many reviewers liked it', I'm going to ask you to PM me a link to your draft. I would like to see how you developed this concept to make sure this is still up to the site expectations.</p>
<p>Feel free to contact a member of the <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/butterfly-squad-roster">Butterfly Squad</a> to get more crit.</p>

